      "q": "How much does New Tech Solutions make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "New Tech Solutions has $324M in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date. New Tech Solutions received 1,985 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $163K. New Tech Solutions saw obligations down 45.6% year over year."
